# 🎮 Game Developer Implementation Plan: MathMagic Intelligent Game Engines

A complete game design and technical implementation plan to build the **MathMagic Gamified Recall & Mini-Game Engine**, transforming math revision into engaging, arcade-style micro-games with an adaptive spaced-repetition backend.

---

## 🎯 Game Philosophy & Core Rules

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 1. **Zero Frustration (No Unlearned Concepts)**: Games NEVER introduce concepts the student hasn't learned. The game engine dynamically pulls questions strictly from exercises completed in the **Learn Tab**.
> 2. **Adaptive Recall Engine**: Uses weighted algorithms to automatically prioritize **weak skills (low accuracy in practice)**, **mistakes made in drills**, and **spaced-repetition review of older topics**.
> 3. **Juicy Game Feel**: Fast animations, visual feedback, live combo multipliers ($1\times \rightarrow 2\times \rightarrow 3\times$), haptics, and celebration victory podiums.

---

## 🕹️ The 8 Micro-Games Design Specification

| # | Game Title | Genre / Mechanics | Visual & Interaction Design |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **1** | **⚡ Quick Math** | *Speed Drill Runner* | 60-second time-attack challenge with combo multiplier ($1\times, 2\times, 3\times, 5\times$) for rapid consecutive correct answers. |
| **2** | **🧩 Number Match** | *Tile Pairer* | Two-column matching puzzle: tap an equation on the left (e.g. $4 + 5$) and its match on the right ($9$) to clear the board. |
| **3** | **🧠 Memory Math** | *Card Flip Grid* | $4\times 3$ grid of face-down cards. Flip two cards to find matching question-and-answer pairs. |
| **4** | **🍎 Math Catch** | *Falling Arcade* | Target clue shown at top (e.g., *"Numbers greater than 10"* or *"Adds up to 7"*). Tap correct falling fruit before they hit the ground! |
| **5** | **🔍 Shape & Pattern Hunt** | *Visual Explorer* | Interactive visual puzzle where students identify target 2D/3D shapes or pick the next element in animated patterns. |
| **6** | **⏰ Clock Challenge** | *Analog Dial Reader* | Interactive clock face where students read time or drag hands to match the target time. |
| **7** | **💰 Market Stall** | *Coin & Money Sim* | Grocery checkout stall: select coins and currency notes to pay exact amounts and make change. |
| **8** | **👑 Mixed Recall Arena** | *Boss Arena* | 10-question mixed-topic challenge drawing from all mastered topics to earn high XP and unlock mastery trophies. |

