## 🧠 Backend Smart Question Selection Algorithm

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Student starts Game (e.g. Quick Math)"] --> B["Fetch student's UserProgress"]
    B --> C{"Any exercises completed?"}
    C -- No --> D["Return Grade 1 beginner pool (Pre-number / Counting)"]
    C -- Yes --> E["Collect Question Pool from Completed Exercises"]

    E --> F["Categorize & Weight Questions:"]
    F --> G["1. Weak Skills (Mistakes & low drill scores) — 40% Weight"]
    F --> H["2. Spaced Repetition (Older topics > 5 days ago) — 30% Weight"]
    F --> I["3. Recently Learned (Last 3 days) — 20% Weight"]
    F --> J["4. General Mastered Review — 10% Weight"]

    G & H & I & J --> K["Weighted Shuffle & Pick N Questions (10–20 Qs)"]
    K --> L["Create Game Session in DB\nPOST /api/v1/games/generate"]
    L --> M["Return { gameSessionId, questions } to Mobile App"]
```

