## 🔄 Core Gameplay Loop (State Machine)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> GameSelectMenu: Browse 8 Micro-Games
    GameSelectMenu --> PreGameCountdown: Tap Play (Fetch Questions)
    PreGameCountdown --> ActiveGameplay: 3.. 2.. 1.. GO!
    
    state ActiveGameplay {
        [*] --> QuestionDisplay
        QuestionDisplay --> AnswerInput: MCQ / Tap / Keypad / Drag
        AnswerInput --> FeedbackAndCombo: Correct (+Combo) / Wrong (Reset Combo)
        FeedbackAndCombo --> NextQuestion: Load Next or Deduct Life
    }
    
    ActiveGameplay --> GameOverState: Time Expired / Lives 0 / All Solved
    GameOverState --> SubmitResults: POST /api/v1/games/session
    SubmitResults --> VictoryPodiumModal: Display XP, Score, Combo, Highscore Badge
    VictoryPodiumModal --> ActiveGameplay: Play Again
    VictoryPodiumModal --> GameSelectMenu: Back to Games
```

